properties.statement:
A design holding inference steps has three things counted and listed by loop_status and detect_gaps, not only by reasoning_report:
- its unconfirmed steps;
- its uncited premises;
- its claims that read "shown" but not "proven".

A definition or axiom can be marked TAKEN AS GIVEN. It is then a stated foundation, not an uncited premise, and it carries no budget fields such as direction.

From the primes trial, item 4 (F14, F15, F5). @ajs, 2026-10-17.
